[[3,10,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Place the car on the ramp.</p><p>Disconnect the battery negative terminal.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Battery</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2889704\">A1</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>1. Working from inside the vehicle, remove the protective boot for\nthe handbrake lever.</p><p>2. Loosen the adjustment nut for the handbrake cable.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2034894.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[3,10,0,"<p><a href=\"#/2891740\">4450B11</a></p><p>1. Release the handbrake cable and move aside.</p><p>2. Unscrew brake caliper retaining bolts (2a) and remove caliper\n (2b).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2034895.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[3,10,0,"<p>Release the rear brake pads.</p><p>1. Undo the rear brake caliper bracket retaining bolts.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2034896.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[3,10,0,"<p>Remove the caliper bracket.</p>"],[3,10,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Fit the caliper bracket.</p><p>Tighten the bracket fixing bolts to torque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>REAR BRAKE CALIPER BRACKET</p></td><td><p>M12 x 1</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>10.5</p></td></tr></table></div><p>Fit  the rear brake pads.</p><p>Refit the brake caliper and tighten the\nretaining bolts to torque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>REAR BRAKE CALIPER</p></td><td><p>M10</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>5.7</p></td></tr></table></div><p>Connect the handbrake cable to the brake\ncaliper.</p><p><a href=\"#/2891740\">4450B11</a></p><p>Lower the vehicle.</p><p><a href=\"#/2891661\">3380A04</a></p><p>Connect the battery negative terminal.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Battery</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2889704\">A1</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>Remove the car from the ramps.</p>"]]